StrmLight
=========

StrmLight is a fork of Moonlight for Android
(https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-android), made to stream
StrmQt, a native Emby client, from a Sunshine host to Android TV and Fire TV
devices. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Moonlight project.

Forked from upstream commit b48494cb ("Version 12.2").

